    ! #237: "For tickets with suggestions, the first actionable suggestion appears as the primary button or owner picker" - The first step becomes the primary control only when it is actionable. If no suggestion is actionable, it falls back to a caption rather than a button or owner picker.
    ! #223: "You can rely on its success claims as confirmation that the action completed" - The facts describe a system-prompt rule against claiming a change without a successful tool result. They do not establish that the assistant will always obey it, so this assurance overstates the change.

